    {
        "content": "<p>There is now a chain of PRs which implements this throughout Mathlib: { <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36546\">#36546</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36547\">#36547</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36548\">#36548</a> } → <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36549\">#36549</a> → { <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36552\">#36552</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36553\">#36553</a> } → <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36418\">#36418</a>. The first three are just preliminary for a few minor changes I make later, but they should be easy to merge. <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/36549\">#36549</a> is the main PR in the list, and the latter three add some nice instances to have for <code>IsMulCommutative</code>.</p>",
